---
description: Prepare one constructSystem evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: CreativeDirection[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Turn the selected direction into reusable principles and examples across likely contexts. Define how the system behaves in error messages, sensitive situations, and ordinary promotion, preserving consistency without requiring every asset to sound identical. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
